Package: pcmprsk
Type: Package
Title: Parametric Regression Models for the Cumulative Incidence Function
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sang Kyu", "Lee", email = "leesa111@msu.edu", role = "aut"), 
    person("Jae Hwan", "Kim", email = "jaehwan5025@gmail.com", role = "aut"),
    person("Jeong Won", "Ahn", email = "anjw0824@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Fits parametric regression models for the cumulative
    incidence function in competing risks data using the generalized
    odds rate transformation model of Jeong and Fine (2007).
    Provides maximum likelihood estimation, statistical inference, 
    confidence intervals for specified covariate values,
    prediction of cumulative incidence functions and estimation of cure fractions.
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
License: GPL-3
